OL,3,GNEWSAFormer crime unit boss to head
OL,4,Agambling commission
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe former head of the crime unit has
OL,7,Ftaken over the lead of Jersey's
OL,8,Fgambling commission.
OL,10,FBarry Faudemer, the former head of the
OL,11,Fjoint Police and Customs Financial
OL,12,FCrimes Unit and an FBI Academy
OL,13,Fgraduate, has been appointed as the
OL,14,Fchairman of the Jersey Gambling
OL,15,FCommission board for a four-year term.
OL,17,FThe commission said Faudemer brought
OL,18,Fextensive experience in regulation,
OL,19,Ffinancial crime prevention and law
OL,20,Fenforcement.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
